Print #1,1+2*3-4/2;7 mod 3;-7 mod 3;2^10
Print #1,100/7;-100/7;Abs(-5);Sgn(-3);Sgn(0);Sgn(9)
Print #1,Abs(0);Abs(7);Abs(-2147483647-1);Abs(-1.5);Sgn(-2.5);Sgn(2147483647);Sgn(-2147483647-1)
A=-12 : B=Abs(A)+Sgn(A)*2 : Print #1,B;Abs(Sgn(A))
Print #1,$FF+%1010;$7FFFFFFF;-2147483647-1
Print #1,5 and 3;5 or 3;5 xor 3;Not 0
Print #1,3>2;2>3;3>=3;2<=1;1<>2
Print #1,Max(3,9);Min(3,9);Int(3.7);Int(-3.7)
Print #1,1.5+2.25;10.0/4;3.14159*2;1E5;1.5E-3
Print #1,Sqr(2);Sin(0);Cos(0);Tan(0)
Degree : Print #1,Sin(90);Cos(180);Atan(1)
Radian : Print #1,Pi#;Exp(1);Ln(10);Log(100)
A=10 : Inc A : Print #1,A : Dec A : Dec A : Print #1,A
A=5 : Add A,10 : Print #1,A : Add A,-3,0 To 100 : Print #1,A
X#=1.0/3.0 : Print #1,X#;X#*3
Randomize 42 : R=Rnd(1000) : Print #1,R>=0 and R<=1000
